[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822241200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115579#issuecomment-3822241200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115579","id":3822241200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j0sWw","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T07:17:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T07:17:44Z","body":"This also seems related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108175 too.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3822241200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3959380271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115579#issuecomment-3959380271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115579","id":3959380271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r_1kv","user":{"login":"Hrothdel","id":32814943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODE0OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32814943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel","html_url":"https://github.com/Hrothdel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T13:49:32Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T13:49:32Z","body":"> A void function can still return a call to another void function.\r\n\r\nThe current implementation emits an error for returning `null` inside a `void` function, but returning a call to another `void` function is allowed.  This feels really inconsistent to me, but I might be missing something. The existing check seems really deliberate, as there is even a specific warning for returning calls to untyped functions (`GDScriptWarning::UNSAFE_VOID_RETURN`). What would be a use case for this kind of returns?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3959380271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3960768493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115579#issuecomment-3960768493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115579","id":3960768493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sFIft","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T17:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T17:20:42Z","body":"Use case is a bit shorter code. In example,\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc execute() -> void:\r\n\tif not has_network_connection():\r\n\t\treturn reconnect_to_server()\r\n\r\n\tif not is_valid_password():\r\n\t\treturn show_warning(NOT_VALID_PASSWORD)\r\n\r\n\tif not is_alive_player():\r\n\t\treturn revive_player()\r\n\r\n\t# ... etc\r\n\t# do something\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's a small, but sometimes it's nice to be able write code like this. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3960768493/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3961601017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115579#issuecomment-3961601017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115579","id":3961601017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sITv5","user":{"login":"Hrothdel","id":32814943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODE0OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32814943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel","html_url":"https://github.com/Hrothdel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T19:43:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T19:43:40Z","body":"That's valid, thank you for the example! It still feels kind of inconsistent to me, but I guess it doesn't hurt to allow it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3961601017/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]